{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/richmond-district-mira-developments-al-furjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1458,"crm_id":"7929","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Richmond District","slug":"richmond-district-mira-developments-al-furjan","display_address":"Al Furjan","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Mira Developments","price":890000,"display_price":"890k","lattitude":25.023944966303,"longitude":55.132544262868,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>John Richmond District in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-furjan/\">Al Furjan</a> Dubai is a contemporary mixed-use development by Mira Developments, bringing together five residential buildings and one office tower within a unified podium of retail, wellness, and leisure. Rising across nine floors, it features <strong>studio, 1 and 2-bedroom apartments</strong> with interiors by John Richmond, complemented by resort-style pools, fitness areas, yoga zones, and curated dining experiences. The units can be booked with a 10% down payment.</p><p>Richmond District by<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.offplan-dubai.com/dubai-developer/mira-development/\"> Mira Developments</a> is designed to seamlessly integrate architecture, lifestyle, and connectivity, enhanced by modern mashrabiya elements that elevate both privacy and visual identity. Positioned for strong capital appreciation, the development is defined by its vibrant podium, lifestyle amenities, and a dynamic environment that supports both everyday living and long-term value.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_a518e4f6f8.jpg","hash":"Feature_a518e4f6f8","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_im